use firn/tags

wl-clipboard is a Module
wl-clipboard is tagged desktop

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.wl-clipboard.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.wl-clipboard]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."wl-clipboard"."enable": enable "Wayland clipboard utilities"
